    .feed-content p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .evidence-line {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
    }

    .feed-action {
      min-width: 104px;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .action-done {
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .me-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 350px;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .model-list {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .model-card {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 25px 4px;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: transparent;
      text-align: left;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr) 30px;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .model-card:hover .model-statement { color: var(--accent-dark); }

    .model-card.active .model-arrow {
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .model-category {
      padding-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .model-statement {
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 23px;
      line-height: 1.38;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      transition: color 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .model-arrow {
      padding-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: transform 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .evidence-panel {
      position: sticky;
      top: 28px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .evidence-panel small {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .evidence-panel h3 {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .evidence-panel > p {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .evidence-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .evidence-item {
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .evidence-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .evidence-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .control-intro {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 19px 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .control-intro strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .control-intro p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .control-table {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .control-row {
      min-height: 104px;
      padding: 19px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(230px, 1.2fr) repeat(3, minmax(130px, 0.7fr)) 76px;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .control-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

    .control-head {
      min-height: 54px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    }

    .app-name {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
    }

    .app-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: var(--bg);
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .app-name strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .app-name span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .permission {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .permission strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .switch {
      width: 50px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 3px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: oklch(0.91 0.01 255);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      transition: background 160ms var(--ease), border-color 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .switch::after {
      content: "";
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px oklch(0.2 0.03 258 / 0.2);
      transition: transform 180ms var(--ease);
    }

    .switch[aria-pressed="true"] {
      border-color: var(--fg);
      background: var(--fg);
    }

    .switch[aria-pressed="true"]::after {
      transform: translateX(20px);
    }

    .drawer-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 28px;
      background: oklch(0.14 0.025 258 / 0.42);
      display: grid;
      justify-items: end;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: opacity 140ms var(--ease), visibility 140ms;
    }

    .drawer-backdrop.open {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
    }

    .drawer {
      width: min(580px, 100%);
      height: 100%;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.2);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 100px oklch(0.1 0.02 258 / 0.22);
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateX(20px);
      transition: transform 210ms var(--ease);
    }

    .drawer-backdrop.open .drawer { transform: translateX(0); }

    .drawer-head {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .drawer-progress {
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
    }

    .close-button {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .close-button:hover { background: oklch(0.94 0.01 255); }

    .review-label {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--warning);
      font: 600 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .review-title {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 34px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .review-subtitle {
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .diff-block {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .diff-side {
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .diff-side + .diff-side { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    .diff-side.after { background: var(--accent-soft); }

    .diff-side small {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .diff-side p {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: var(--display);
      font-size: 20px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .reason-list {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    }

    .reason-list strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .reason-list ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .more-evidence {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: max-height 200ms var(--ease), opacity 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .more-evidence.open {
      max-height: 180px;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .drawer-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 28px;
      z-index: 20;
      min-width: 260px;
      padding: 13px 17px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--fg);
      color: var(--surface);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, 12px);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 170ms var(--ease), transform 170ms var(--ease);
    }

    .toast.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, 0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .summary-item:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
      .summary-item:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .me-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .evidence-panel { position: static; }
      .control-row {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 1fr) repeat(3, 110px) 60px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .app-shell { display: block; }
      .sidebar {
        position: static;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
      }
      .nav {
        margin-left: auto;
        grid-auto-flow: column;
      }
      .nav-button { min-height: 44px; }
      .nav-button span:first-child { display: none; }
      .sidebar-note { display: none; }
      .main { padding: 16px 20px 48px; }
      .page-head { padding-top: 30px; }
      h1 { font-size: 44px; }
      .feed-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
      .feed-action { text-align: left; }
      .control-table { overflow-x: auto; }
      .control-row { min-width: 820px; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" data-od-id="primary-navigation">
      <div class="brand" data-od-id="product-brand">
        <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">M</div>
        <div class="brand-name">Memory Lens</div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="주요 화면">
        <button class="nav-button active" data-screen="home" data-od-id="nav-home">
          <span>Home</span>
          <span class="nav-count" id="navDecisionCount">2</span>
        </button>
        <button class="nav-button" data-screen="me" data-od-id="nav-me">
          <span>Me</span>
        </button>
        <button class="nav-button" data-screen="control" data-od-id="nav-control">
          <span>Control</span>
        </button>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-note" data-od-id="automation-status">
        <strong>자동 관리 중</strong>
        <p>확신할 수 있는 기억은 조용히 정리하고, 판단이 필요한 변화만 보여드립니다.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main" id="content">
      <header class="topbar" data-od-id="top-status">
        <div class="status-pill">
          <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          마지막 동기화 · 방금 전
        </div>
        <div class="avatar" aria-label="사용자 프로필">IH</div>
      </header>

      <section class="screen active" id="home" data-od-id="home-screen">
        <div class="page-head">
          <div class="eyebrow">이번 주 메모리 변화</div>
          <h1 data-od-id="home-heading">AI가 당신을 새롭게 이해한 방식</h1>
          <p>기억 목록을 관리할 필요가 없습니다. Memory Lens가 변화와 충돌을 찾고, 확신이 부족한 두 가지 판단만 요청합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-grid" data-od-id="weekly-summary">
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-strengthened">
            <span class="summary-label">강화된 이해</span>
            <span class="summary-value">12</span>
          </article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-outdated">
            <span class="summary-label">오래된 것으로 추정</span>
            <span class="summary-value">4</span>
          </article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-contextualized">
            <span class="summary-label">맥락을 찾은 충돌</span>
            <span class="summary-value">3</span>
          </article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-archived">
            <span class="summary-label">자동 보관</span>
            <span class="summary-value">18</span>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="decision-callout" id="decisionCallout" data-od-id="decision-callout">
          <div class="decision-copy">
            <div class="decision-number" id="decisionNumber">2</div>
            <div>
              <strong>당신의 판단이 필요한 변화가 있습니다</strong>
              <span>예상 소요 시간 47초</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button class="primary-button" id="startReview" data-od-id="start-review">검토 시작</button>
        </div>

        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2 data-od-id="feed-heading">무엇이 달라졌나요</h2>
            <p>아무것도 하지 않으면 신뢰도에 따라 자동으로 반영됩니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="변화 유형 필터">
            <button class="filter active" data-filter="all" data-od-id="filter-all">전체</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="changed" data-od-id="filter-changed">변화</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="fading" data-od-id="filter-fading">소멸</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="context" data-od-id="filter-context">맥락</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feed" data-od-id="memory-change-feed">
          <article class="feed-card" data-type="changed" data-od-id="feed-card-framework">
            <div class="feed-type changed">Changed</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>이제 Flutter를 가장 먼저 선택하지 않을 수 있습니다.</h3>
              <p>지난 90일간 시작한 새 프로젝트 6개 중 Flutter로 시작한 프로젝트는 1개였습니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>근거 14개</span><span>확신도 높음</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">변화 보기</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="fading" data-od-id="feed-card-student-collective">
            <div class="feed-type fading">Fading</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>“OpenAI Student Collective 지원 준비 중”</h3>
              <p>특정 이벤트에 묶인 기억으로, 현재 일반적인 답변에는 더 이상 필요하지 않은 것으로 보입니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>자동 보관 예정</span><span>3일 후</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">계속 유지</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="changed" data-od-id="feed-card-preference-merge">
            <div class="feed-type merged">Merged</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>두 디자인 취향을 하나의 선호로 정리했습니다.</h3>
              <p>“정보량이 많은 UI를 싫어함”과 “여백이 많은 디자인을 선호함”을 더 정확한 하나의 문장으로 병합했습니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>중복 기억 2개</span><span>자동 반영됨</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">결과 보기</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="context" data-od-id="feed-card-speed-quality">
            <div class="feed-type context">Context</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>속도와 완성도는 충돌하지 않았습니다.</h3>
              <p>해커톤에서는 실행 속도를, 소비자 제품에서는 디자인 완성도를 우선하는 조건부 패턴을 발견했습니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>근거 23개</span><span>새 맥락 생성</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">근거 확인</button></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="screen" id="me" data-od-id="me-screen">
        <div class="page-head">
          <div class="eyebrow">Memory Lens</div>
          <h1 data-od-id="me-heading">AI는 나를 어떻게 이해하고 있나요?</h1>
          <p>수백 개의 개별 기억을 사람이 읽을 수 있는 모델로 압축했습니다. 문장을 선택하면 그 판단의 근거가 열립니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="me-layout">
          <div class="model-list" data-od-id="personal-model-list">
            <button class="model-card active" data-model="work" data-od-id="model-work">
              <span class="model-category">Work</span>
              <span class="model-statement">빠른 실행을 중요하게 생각하지만, 소비자 제품에서는 디자인 완성도를 쉽게 타협하지 않는다.</span>
              <span class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
            <button class="model-card" data-model="coding" data-od-id="model-coding">
              <span class="model-category">Coding</span>
              <span class="model-statement">AI 코딩 도구를 적극적으로 사용하며, 특정 프레임워크에는 이전보다 덜 고착되어 있다.</span>
              <span class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
            <button class="model-card" data-model="projects" data-od-id="model-projects">
              <span class="model-category">Projects</span>
              <span class="model-statement">여러 프로젝트를 동시에 탐색하고, 가능성이 낮으면 빠르게 폐기하거나 전환하는 편이다.</span>
              <span class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
            <button class="model-card" data-model="preferences" data-od-id="model-preferences">
              <span class="model-category">Preferences</span>
              <span class="model-statement">정보량이 절제되고 시각적 위계가 강한 인터페이스를 선호한다.</span>
              <span class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
            <button class="model-card" data-model="current" data-od-id="model-current-life">
              <span class="model-category">Current life</span>
              <span class="model-statement">최근 해커톤과 AI 제품 실험에 집중하고 있다.</span>
              <span class="model-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <aside class="evidence-panel" data-od-id="model-evidence-panel" aria-live="polite">
            <small>왜 그렇게 생각하나요</small>
            <h3 id="evidenceTitle">속도와 완성도의 조건</h3>
            <p id="evidenceSummary">서로 모순되어 보이던 두 선호가 작업 맥락에 따라 달라진다는 패턴을 발견했습니다.</p>
            <div class="evidence-list" id="evidenceList"></div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="screen" id="control" data-od-id="control-screen">
        <div class="page-head">
          <div class="eyebrow">공유 범위</div>
          <h1 data-od-id="control-heading">누가 무엇을 알 수 있나요?</h1>
          <p>기억을 하나씩 공개하지 않고, AI마다 필요한 이해의 범위를 결정합니다. 변경 내용은 다음 대화부터 적용됩니다.</p>
        </div>

