현재 파일을 같은 이름으로 갱신할 수 있도록, 폰트와 Home 상단 경험을 개편한 완성본을 제공합니다.

<artifact identifier="memory-lens-desktop" type="text/html" title="Memory Lens 데스크탑 앱">
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Memory Lens — AI가 이해한 나</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: oklch(0.975 0.008 255);
      --surface: oklch(0.995 0.003 255);
      --fg: oklch(0.205 0.02 258);
      --muted: oklch(0.53 0.022 258);
      --border: oklch(0.895 0.014 255);
      --accent: oklch(0.58 0.19 255);
      --accent-dark: oklch(0.48 0.18 258);
      --accent-soft: oklch(0.94 0.035 258);
      --success: oklch(0.56 0.13 155);
      --warning: oklch(0.68 0.14 70);
      --danger: oklch(0.59 0.17 25);
      --night: oklch(0.145 0.025 258);
      --night-raised: oklch(0.195 0.028 258);
      --shadow: 0 18px 60px oklch(0.2 0.03 258 / 0.09);
      --display: "Avenir Next", "SUIT Variable", "SUIT", "Pretendard Variable", "Pretendard", sans-serif;
      --body: "Pretendard Variable", "Pretendard", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Segoe UI Variable", sans-serif;
      --mono: "SFMono-Regular", "Cascadia Code", Consolas, monospace;
      --ease: cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--fg);
      font-family: var(--body);
    }

    body { overflow-x: hidden; }
    button, input { font: inherit; }

    button {
      color: inherit;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible,
    [tabindex]:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid oklch(0.72 0.15 255);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .app-shell {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 232px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 3;
      height: 100vh;
      padding: 28px 20px 22px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: oklch(0.985 0.006 255);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      padding: 0 8px;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--fg);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 650 13px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .brand-name {
      font: 680 18px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .nav {
      display: grid;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .nav-button {
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 0 13px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      text-align: left;
      transition: background 180ms var(--ease), color 180ms var(--ease);
    }

    .nav-button:hover {
      background: oklch(0.945 0.012 255);
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .nav-button.active {
      background: var(--fg);
      color: var(--surface);
    }

    .nav-count {
      min-width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      padding: 0 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 11px var(--mono);
    }

    .sidebar-note {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .sidebar-note strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .sidebar-note p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .main {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1420px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 26px 38px 60px;
    }

    .topbar {
      min-height: 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .status-pill {
      min-height: 36px;
      padding: 0 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--muted);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--success);
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 12px var(--mono);
    }

    .screen { display: none; }

    .screen.active {
      display: block;
      animation: reveal 220ms var(--ease);
    }

    @keyframes reveal {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .memory-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 610px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--night);
      color: oklch(0.97 0.008 255);
      box-shadow: 0 26px 70px oklch(0.12 0.03 258 / 0.18);
    }

    .memory-hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: 0.22;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(oklch(1 0 0 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, oklch(1 0 0 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 46px 46px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, black, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      width: 51%;
      min-height: 520px;
      padding: 72px 30px 48px 58px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 19px;
      color: oklch(0.75 0.11 250);
      font: 650 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.13em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .hero-copy h1 {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 0 0 19px;
      font: 620 clamp(46px, 5.1vw, 76px)/0.98 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    }

    .hero-copy > p {
      max-width: 540px;
      margin: 0 0 30px;
      color: oklch(0.78 0.018 255);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.72;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 9px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .hero-primary,
    .hero-secondary {
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 680;
      transition: transform 160ms var(--ease), background 160ms var(--ease), border-color 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .hero-primary {
      border: 1px solid white;
      background: white;
      color: var(--night);
    }

    .hero-primary:hover {
      border-color: oklch(0.9 0.01 255);
      background: oklch(0.9 0.01 255);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .hero-secondary {
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.22);
      background: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.06);
      color: white;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    .hero-secondary:hover {
      border-color: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.42);
      background: oklch(1 0 0 / 0.12);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .orbit-stage {
      position: absolute;
      top: 22px;
      right: -20px;
      width: 54%;
      height: 520px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      isolation: isolate;
    }

    .orbit-stage::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, oklch(0.66 0.19 245 / 0.13), transparent 68%);
      filter: blur(18px);
      z-index: -2;
    }

    .orbit-ring {
      position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid oklch(0.88 0.04 255 / 0.16);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .orbit-ring.one {
      width: 270px;
      height: 270px;
      animation: ringBreath 6s var(--ease) infinite alternate;
    }

    .orbit-ring.two {
      width: 410px;
      height: 410px;
      border-style: dashed;
      border-color: oklch(0.88 0.04 255 / 0.11);
      animation: ringRotate 44s linear infinite;
    }

    .orbit-ring.three {
      width: 520px;
      height: 520px;
      border-color: oklch(0.88 0.04 255 / 0.07);
    }

    @keyframes ringBreath {
      from { transform: scale(0.97); opacity: 0.65; }
      to { transform: scale(1.03); opacity: 1; }
    }

    @keyframes ringRotate {
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .memory-core {
      position: relative;
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 36% 30%, oklch(0.96 0.08 215), transparent 15%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 68% 67%, oklch(0.58 0.24 305), transparent 31%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 34% 68%, oklch(0.65 0.2 225), transparent 36%),
        oklch(0.3 0.08 260);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 30px oklch(0.67 0.2 250 / 0.36),
        0 0 90px oklch(0.58 0.19 285 / 0.22),
        inset -16px -18px 30px oklch(0.12 0.05 265 / 0.4);
      animation: coreFloat 5.5s var(--ease) infinite alternate;
    }

    .memory-core::before,
    .memory-core::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      inset: -12px;
      border: 1px solid oklch(0.92 0.07 250 / 0.22);
      animation: corePulse 3.6s var(--ease) infinite;
    }

    .memory-core::after {
      inset: -28px;
      animation-delay: 1.2s;
    }

    @keyframes coreFloat {
      from { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(-3deg); }
      to { transform: translateY(8px) rotate(4deg); }
    }

    @keyframes corePulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.18; transform: scale(0.94); }
      50% { opacity: 0.75; transform: scale(1.03); }
    }

    .core-label {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: grid;
      place-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: white;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 14px oklch(0.1 0.05 260 / 0.5);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .core-label strong {
      font: 700 21px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .core-label span {
      margin-top: 4px;
      color: oklch(0.91 0.035 250);
      font: 9px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .orbit-track {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .orbit-memory {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      offset-path: circle(188px at 0 0);
      offset-rotate: 0deg;
      animation: orbitMemory 26s linear infinite;
      pointer-events: auto;
    }

    .orbit-memory:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -4.3s; }
    .orbit-memory:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: -8.6s; }
    .orbit-memory:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: -12.9s; }
    .orbit-memory:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: -17.2s; }
    .orbit-memory:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: -21.5s; }

    @keyframes orbitMemory {
      from { offset-distance: 0%; }
      to { offset-distance: 100%; }
    }

    .memory-chip {
      max-width: 176px;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 8px 11px;
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.17);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: oklch(0.19 0.03 258 / 0.75);
      color: oklch(0.91 0.014 255);
      box-shadow: 0 9px 24px oklch(0.06 0.02 258 / 0.25);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      white-space: nowrap;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      transition: background 160ms var(--ease), border-color 160ms var(--ease), transform 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .memory-chip:hover {
      border-color: oklch(0.78 0.12 250 / 0.75);
      background: oklch(0.27 0.055 258 / 0.92);
      transform: scale(1.04);
    }

    .hero-report-strip {
      position: absolute;
      left: 24px;
      right: 24px;
      bottom: 20px;
      z-index: 2;
      min-height: 72px;
      padding: 0 22px;
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.12);
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: oklch(0.2 0.025 258 / 0.72);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr repeat(3, 1fr);
      align-items: center;
    }

    .report-intro strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .report-intro span,
    .report-stat span {
      color: oklch(0.7 0.018 255);
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .report-stat {
      padding-left: 24px;
      border-left: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.11);
    }

    .report-stat strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      font: 650 17px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .page-head {
      max-width: 760px;
      padding: 48px 0 34px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      font: 650 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

    .page-head h1 {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font: 650 clamp(40px, 4.4vw, 64px)/1.02 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.058em;
    }

    .page-head p {
      max-width: 610px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .summary-grid {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .summary-item {
      min-height: 126px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .summary-item:last-child { border-right: 0; }
    .summary-label { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }

    .summary-value {
      font: 620 32px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .decision-callout {
      margin-bottom: 34px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--fg);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--fg);
      color: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .decision-copy {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .decision-number {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.25);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 16px var(--mono);
    }

    .decision-callout strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .decision-callout span {
      color: oklch(0.83 0.015 255);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .primary-button,
    .secondary-button,
    .text-button {
      min-height: 44px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      transition: transform 150ms var(--ease), background 150ms var(--ease), border-color 150ms var(--ease);
    }

    .primary-button {
      padding: 0 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 680;
    }

    .primary-button:hover {
      background: var(--accent-dark);
      border-color: var(--accent-dark);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .decision-callout .primary-button {
      border-color: var(--surface);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .decision-callout .primary-button:hover {
      border-color: oklch(0.9 0.01 255);
      background: oklch(0.9 0.01 255);
    }

    .secondary-button {
      padding: 0 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .secondary-button:hover {
      border-color: var(--fg);
      background: oklch(0.96 0.008 255);
    }

    .text-button {
      min-width: 44px;
      padding: 0 8px;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-weight: 680;
    }

    .text-button:hover { background: oklch(0.945 0.012 255); }

    .section-head {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font: 650 24px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .filter-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .filter {
      min-height: 38px;
      padding: 0 13px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .filter:hover { color: var(--fg); }

    .filter.active {
      border-color: var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .feed {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .feed-card {
      min-height: 170px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 122px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 26px;
      align-items: start;
      transition: border-color 180ms var(--ease), box-shadow 180ms var(--ease);
    }

    .feed-card:hover {
      border-color: oklch(0.75 0.025 255);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px oklch(0.2 0.03 258 / 0.05);
    }

    .feed-card.is-hidden { display: none; }

    .feed-type {
      padding-top: 3px;
      font: 650 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .feed-type.changed { color: var(--accent-dark); }
    .feed-type.fading { color: var(--warning); }
    .feed-type.merged { color: var(--success); }
    .feed-type.context { color: var(--danger); }

    .feed-content h3 {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font: 650 20px/1.35 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .feed-content p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .evidence-line {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
    }

    .feed-action {
      min-width: 104px;
      text-align: right;
    }

    .action-done {
      color: var(--success);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 680;
    }

    .me-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 350px;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .model-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    .model-card {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 25px 4px;
      border: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: transparent;
      text-align: left;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr) 30px;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .model-card:hover .model-statement { color: var(--accent-dark); }

    .model-card.active .model-arrow {
      color: var(--accent-dark);
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }

    .model-category {
      padding-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .model-statement {
      font: 570 20px/1.48 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      transition: color 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .model-arrow {
      padding-top: 5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      transition: transform 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .evidence-panel {
      position: sticky;
      top: 28px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .evidence-panel small {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .evidence-panel h3 {
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      font: 650 21px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .evidence-panel > p {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .evidence-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }

    .evidence-item {
      padding: 13px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .evidence-item strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .evidence-item span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .control-intro {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 19px 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--surface);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .control-intro strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .control-intro p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .control-table {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: var(--surface);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .control-row {
      min-height: 104px;
      padding: 19px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(230px, 1.2fr) repeat(3, minmax(130px, 0.7fr)) 76px;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .control-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }

    .control-head {
      min-height: 54px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    }

    .app-name {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
    }

    .app-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--bg);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font: 650 15px var(--display);
    }

    .app-name strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .app-name span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .permission {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .permission strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      color: var(--fg);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .switch {
      width: 50px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 3px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: oklch(0.91 0.01 255);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      transition: background 160ms var(--ease), border-color 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .switch::after {
      content: "";
      width: 20px;
      height: 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px oklch(0.2 0.03 258 / 0.2);
      transition: transform 180ms var(--ease);
    }

    .switch[aria-pressed="true"] {
      border-color: var(--fg);
      background: var(--fg);
    }

    .switch[aria-pressed="true"]::after { transform: translateX(20px); }

    .overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      padding: 28px;
      background: oklch(0.11 0.025 258 / 0.52);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
      transition: opacity 140ms var(--ease), visibility 140ms;
    }

    .overlay.align-right { justify-items: end; }

    .overlay.open {
      opacity: 1;
      visibility: visible;
    }

    .dialog,
    .drawer {
      border: 1px solid oklch(1 0 0 / 0.2);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 100px oklch(0.1 0.02 258 / 0.24);
      overflow-y: auto;
      transform: translateY(12px);
      transition: transform 210ms var(--ease);
    }

    .overlay.open .dialog,
    .overlay.open .drawer { transform: translate(0); }

    .dialog {
      width: min(680px, 100%);
      max-height: min(760px, 94vh);
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .drawer {
      width: min(580px, 100%);
      height: 100%;
      padding: 28px;
      transform: translateX(20px);
    }

    .dialog-head,
    .drawer-head {
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .dialog-head h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font: 650 25px var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .drawer-progress {
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 11px var(--mono);
    }

    .close-button {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .close-button:hover { background: oklch(0.94 0.01 255); }

    .report-lead {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .report-highlight {
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--night);
      color: white;
    }

    .report-highlight small {
      color: oklch(0.72 0.08 250);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.09em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .report-highlight h3 {
      max-width: 530px;
      margin: 11px 0 9px;
      font: 620 24px/1.35 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .report-highlight p {
      margin: 0;
      color: oklch(0.76 0.018 255);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .report-list {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .report-row {
      padding: 15px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr auto;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .report-row span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .report-row strong {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .report-row b {
      font: 650 13px var(--mono);
    }

    .review-label {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--warning);
      font: 650 10px var(--mono);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .review-title {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font: 650 31px/1.13 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    }

    .review-subtitle {
      margin-bottom: 26px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .diff-block {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .diff-side {
      padding: 20px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .diff-side + .diff-side { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .diff-side.after { background: var(--accent-soft); }

    .diff-side small {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .diff-side p {
      margin: 0;
      font: 570 18px/1.5 var(--display);
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .reason-list {
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
    }

    .reason-list strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .reason-list ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .more-evidence {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: max-height 200ms var(--ease), opacity 160ms var(--ease);
    }

    .more-evidence.open {
      max-height: 180px;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .drawer-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .chat-drawer {
      padding: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
    }

    .chat-head {
      min-height: 82px;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .chat-head strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .chat-head span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .chat-log {
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 26px 22px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .chat-message {
      max-width: 84%;
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    .chat-message.ai {
      align-self: flex-start;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .chat-message.user {
      align-self: flex-end;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--fg);
      color: white;
    }

    .chat-source {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font: 10px var(--mono);
    }

    .chat-composer {
      padding: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .chat-input {
      min-height: 46px;
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 0 14px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--fg);
    }

    .chat-input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }

    .toast {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 28px;
      z-index: 20;
      min-width: 260px;
      padding: 13px 17px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--fg);
      color: var(--surface);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translate(-50%, 12px);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 170ms var(--ease), transform 170ms var(--ease);
    }

    .toast.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translate(-50%, 0);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1160px) {
      .memory-hero { min-height: 700px; }
      .hero-copy { width: 58%; padding-left: 42px; }
      .orbit-stage { right: -95px; width: 57%; }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .summary-item:nth-child(2) { border-right: 0; }
      .summary-item:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .me-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .evidence-panel { position: static; }
      .control-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, 1fr) repeat(3, 110px) 60px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .app-shell { display: block; }
      .sidebar {
        position: static;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 20px;
      }
      .nav { margin-left: auto; grid-auto-flow: column; }
      .nav-button { min-height: 44px; }
      .nav-button span:first-child { display: none; }
      .sidebar-note { display: none; }
      .main { padding: 16px 20px 48px; }
      .memory-hero { min-height: 900px; }
      .hero-copy {
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 390px;
        padding: 52px 32px 30px;
      }
      .hero-copy h1 { font-size: 50px; }
      .orbit-stage {
        top: 350px;
        right: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 450px;
        transform: scale(0.86);
      }
      .hero-report-strip {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        bottom: 15px;
      }
      .report-intro { display: none; }
      .feed-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
      .feed-action { text-align: left; }
      .control-table { overflow-x: auto; }
      .control-row { min-width: 820px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {
      .main { padding-inline: 12px; }
      .memory-hero { min-height: 820px; border-radius: 18px; }
      .hero-copy { padding-inline: 24px; }
      .hero-copy h1 { font-size: 42px; }
      .orbit-stage {
        top: 350px;
        transform: scale(0.7);
      }
      .hero-report-strip { padding: 0 12px; }
      .report-stat { padding-left: 12px; }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .summary-item {
        min-height: 96px;
        border-right: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .decision-callout {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .model-card { grid-template-columns: 86px 1fr 20px; gap: 10px; }
      .overlay { padding: 10px; }
      .report-row { grid-template-columns: 78px 1fr; }
      .report-row b { grid-column: 2; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" data-od-id="primary-navigation">
      <div class="brand" data-od-id="product-brand">
        <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">ML</div>
        <div class="brand-name">Memory Lens</div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="주요 화면">
        <button class="nav-button active" data-screen="home" data-od-id="nav-home">
          <span>Home</span>
          <span class="nav-count" id="navDecisionCount">2</span>
        </button>
        <button class="nav-button" data-screen="me" data-od-id="nav-me"><span>Me</span></button>
        <button class="nav-button" data-screen="control" data-od-id="nav-control"><span>Control</span></button>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-note" data-od-id="automation-status">
        <strong>자동 관리 중</strong>
        <p>확신할 수 있는 기억은 조용히 정리하고, 판단이 필요한 변화만 보여드립니다.</p>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main" id="content">
      <header class="topbar" data-od-id="top-status">
        <div class="status-pill"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>마지막 동기화 · 방금 전</div>
        <div class="avatar" aria-label="사용자 프로필">IH</div>
      </header>

      <section class="screen active" id="home" data-od-id="home-screen">
        <div class="memory-hero" data-od-id="memory-orbit-hero">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <div class="hero-eyebrow">Weekly memory intelligence</div>
            <h1 data-od-id="home-heading">이번 주, 당신에 대한 이해가 달라졌습니다.</h1>
            <p>37개의 변화를 분석했고 대부분은 조용히 정리했습니다. 지금은 AI가 발견한 흐름을 리포트로 보거나, 당신의 기억과 직접 대화할 수 있습니다.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <button class="hero-primary" id="openReport" data-od-id="open-memory-report">리포트 열기</button>
              <button class="hero-secondary" id="openChat" data-od-id="open-memory-chat">메모리와 대화</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="orbit-stage" aria-label="사용자의 기억이 중심 모델 주위를 움직이는 시각화">
            <div class="orbit-ring one"></div>
            <div class="orbit-ring two"></div>
            <div class="orbit-ring three"></div>

            <div class="memory-core" data-od-id="memory-core">
              <div class="core-label">
                <strong>94%</strong>
                <span>자동 정리됨</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="orbit-track">
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">디자인 완성도를 중시함</button></div>
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">AI 코딩 도구를 적극 사용</button></div>
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">해커톤에서는 속도 우선</button></div>
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">Flutter 사용 빈도 감소</button></div>
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">정보량이 절제된 UI 선호</button></div>
              <div class="orbit-memory"><button class="memory-chip">여러 프로젝트를 동시 탐색</button></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-report-strip" data-od-id="hero-report-summary">
            <div class="report-intro">
              <strong>2026년 8월 2주 차</strong>
              <span>개인 메모리 인텔리전스 리포트</span>
            </div>
            <div class="report-stat"><strong>37</strong><span>발견한 변화</span></div>
            <div class="report-stat"><strong>2</strong><span>판단 필요</span></div>
            <div class="report-stat"><strong>18</strong><span>자동 보관</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="summary-grid" data-od-id="weekly-summary">
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-strengthened"><span class="summary-label">강화된 이해</span><span class="summary-value">12</span></article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-outdated"><span class="summary-label">오래된 것으로 추정</span><span class="summary-value">4</span></article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-contextualized"><span class="summary-label">맥락을 찾은 충돌</span><span class="summary-value">3</span></article>
          <article class="summary-item" data-od-id="summary-archived"><span class="summary-label">자동 보관</span><span class="summary-value">18</span></article>
        </div>

        <div class="decision-callout" id="decisionCallout" data-od-id="decision-callout">
          <div class="decision-copy">
            <div class="decision-number" id="decisionNumber">2</div>
            <div><strong>당신의 판단이 필요한 변화가 있습니다</strong><span>예상 소요 시간 47초</span></div>
          </div>
          <button class="primary-button" id="startReview" data-od-id="start-review">검토 시작</button>
        </div>

        <div class="section-head">
          <div>
            <h2 data-od-id="feed-heading">무엇이 달라졌나요</h2>
            <p>아무것도 하지 않으면 신뢰도에 따라 자동으로 반영됩니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="filter-row" role="group" aria-label="변화 유형 필터">
            <button class="filter active" data-filter="all" data-od-id="filter-all">전체</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="changed" data-od-id="filter-changed">변화</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="fading" data-od-id="filter-fading">소멸</button>
            <button class="filter" data-filter="context" data-od-id="filter-context">맥락</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feed" data-od-id="memory-change-feed">
          <article class="feed-card" data-type="changed" data-od-id="feed-card-framework">
            <div class="feed-type changed">Changed</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>이제 Flutter를 가장 먼저 선택하지 않을 수 있습니다.</h3>
              <p>지난 90일간 시작한 새 프로젝트 6개 중 Flutter로 시작한 프로젝트는 1개였습니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>근거 14개</span><span>확신도 높음</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">변화 보기</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="fading" data-od-id="feed-card-student-collective">
            <div class="feed-type fading">Fading</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>“OpenAI Student Collective 지원 준비 중”</h3>
              <p>특정 이벤트에 묶인 기억으로, 현재 일반적인 답변에는 더 이상 필요하지 않은 것으로 보입니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>자동 보관 예정</span><span>3일 후</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">계속 유지</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="changed" data-od-id="feed-card-preference-merge">
            <div class="feed-type merged">Merged</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>두 디자인 취향을 하나의 선호로 정리했습니다.</h3>
              <p>“정보량이 많은 UI를 싫어함”과 “여백이 많은 디자인을 선호함”을 더 정확한 하나의 문장으로 병합했습니다.</p>
              <div class="evidence-line"><span>중복 기억 2개</span><span>자동 반영됨</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="feed-action"><button class="text-button feed-action-button">결과 보기</button></div>
          </article>

          <article class="feed-card" data-type="context" data-od-id="feed-card-speed-quality">
            <div class="feed-type context">Context</div>
            <div class="feed-content">
              <h3>속도와 완성도는 충돌하지 않았습니다.</h3>
